msgstr "操作系统在 SQLITE_FCNTL_ROLLBACK_ATOMIC_WRITE 文件控制上报告了错误。"

#: /workspaces/cppp/rubisco/rubisco/lib/sqlite_strerror.py:463
msgid "The checksum on a page of the database file is incorrect."
msgstr "数据库文件的页面校验和不正确。"

